---
title: Scofflaw
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Scofflaw by Wine Enthusiast, https://www.wineenthusiast.com/recipe/scofflaw-cocktail-recipe-whiskey/
---

Shake the @rye whiskey{45%ml}, @dry vermouth{30%ml}, @lemon juice{22.5%ml}, @grenadine{22.5%ml} and @orange bitters{1%dash} hard with ice in a #cocktail shaker{}.

Fine-strain into a chilled #coupe glass{}.

Twist a strip of @lemon zest{} over the drink.
